## Step 3 — Write the config

The Constellation daemon needs a `config.json` describing this node's identity and group memberships. Edit the values below to match your deployment, then write the file:

<!-- INCLUDE: src/config/constellation.example.json AS ~/.local/share/mem-fusion/constellation/config.json -->

