## Step 5 — Start the Constellation daemon

```bash
launchctl load ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.branchapp.memfusion.constellation.plist
curl -s --retry 12 --retry-delay 1 --retry-connrefused http://127.0.0.1:7533/health >/dev/null \
  && echo "  Constellation up" \
  || { echo "Constellation failed to start — check ~/.local/share/mem-fusion/constellation/logs/constellation-error.log"; exit 1; }
```

---

## Step 6 — Register the Constellation MCP with Claude Code

```bash
claude mcp add --transport http constellation http://127.0.0.1:7533
claude mcp list | grep constellation
```

You should see `constellation: ... - ✓ Connected`.

---

## Step 7 — Smoke test

```bash
curl -s http://127.0.0.1:7533/health    | python3 -m json.tool
curl -s http://127.0.0.1:7533/peers/self | python3 -m json.tool
```

Expect both responses to show your `node_name`, `version`, and `memberships`.

